        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPG-200, Solid Brass White House Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White House Ring Pull has that classic colonial style with just enough grander that we've come to think of when we picture the home of the President. The Solid Brass White House Ring Pull is available in 2 sizes: 2 inch diameter and 3 inch diameter. It is available in a wide array of classic and beautiful finishes. The Field Enterprises Groove Ring Pull can be used not only as a cabinet pull, but also as a dresser drawer pull or other furniture handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Field Enterprises Groove Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Select Size:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RPG-200:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RPG-300:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
